{"seq":1,"slug":"post-processing","title":"后处理效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/advanced-effects/post-processing","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"后处理效果\">后处理效果</h1><p>场景渲染完成的那一刻，结果只是一张躺在显存里的图像。而玩家最终看到的画面——带着电影感的辉光、虚化的背景、恰到好处的色调——往往是这张图被再加工后的产物。后处理就是把渲染结果当作输入纹理，再跑一遍（或多遍）全屏着色器去改造它。它是现代游戏「质感」的重要来源，也是着色器思维从「描述单个表面」跨向「操作整帧画面」的第一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-全屏-pass-与-pipeline\">核心概念：全屏 Pass 与 Pipeline</h2><p>后处理的基本单元是「全屏 pass」：画一个覆盖整个屏幕的三角形（或四边形），让片元着色器对每个屏幕像素执行一次，读取上一阶段的渲染结果纹理，输出处理后的颜色。多个 pass 串成一条后处理链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;场景渲染结果&lt;br/&gt;HDR 颜色 + 深度&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;SSAO&lt;br/&gt;屏幕空间环境光遮蔽&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;泛光 Bloom&lt;br/&gt;提取亮部+模糊+叠加&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;景深 DOF&lt;br/&gt;按深度模糊&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;运动模糊&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;色调映射 Tonemapping&lt;br/&gt;HDR→LDR&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;抗锯齿 TAA/FXAA&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;色彩分级&lt;br/&gt;LUT 调色&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;最终输出到屏幕&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"场景渲染结果&lt;br/&gt;HDR 颜色 + 深度\"] --&gt; B[\"SSAO&lt;br/&gt;屏幕空间环境光遮蔽\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"泛光 Bloom&lt;br/&gt;提取亮部+模糊+叠加\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"景深 DOF&lt;br/&gt;按深度模糊\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"运动模糊\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"色调映射 Tonemapping&lt;br/&gt;HDR→LDR\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"抗锯齿 TAA/FXAA\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"色彩分级&lt;br/&gt;LUT 调色\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"最终输出到屏幕\"]</pre><p>注意顺序极其讲究：HDR 范围的效果（泛光）必须在色调映射之前做，否则高光被压缩后就提取不出亮部；而 LUT 色彩分级一般放在最后。每个 pass 通常需要读取场景深度来还原像素的世界位置，这正用上了 <a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间与变换</a> 里讲的逆向变换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经典后处理效果剖析\">经典后处理效果剖析</h2><p>下表拆解几个最常见效果的着色器原理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>核心算法</th>\n<th>关键技巧</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>泛光 Bloom</td>\n<td>HDR 颜色</td>\n<td>阈值提取亮部→高斯模糊→加回</td>\n<td>降采样金字塔模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>景深 DOF</td>\n<td>颜色+深度</td>\n<td>按到焦平面距离决定模糊半径</td>\n<td>近/远分层避免渗色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSAO</td>\n<td>深度+法线</td>\n<td>半球采样邻域估算遮蔽</td>\n<td>噪声+模糊去条带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调映射</td>\n<td>HDR 颜色</td>\n<td>把无界 HDR 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ACES/AgX 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动模糊</td>\n<td>颜色+速度缓冲</td>\n<td>沿速度方向积分采样</td>\n<td>速度缓冲 G-Buffer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>泛光是最有代表性的多 pass 效果：先用阈值把亮度超过某值的部分提取出来，然后通过一系列降采样 + 高斯模糊形成柔光，最后叠加回原图。高斯模糊本身常拆成水平、垂直两个一维 pass（可分离卷积），把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的采样降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这是后处理性能优化的经典手法，详见 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/shader-optimization\">着色器性能优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色调映射与-hdr\">色调映射与 HDR</h2><p>现代渲染全程在 HDR（高动态范围）线性空间里计算，亮度可以远超 1.0（太阳能到几万）。但显示器只能显示有限范围，所以最后必须做色调映射，把无界的 HDR 压缩到可显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再编码成 sRGB。曲线的选择直接决定画面观感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{out} = \\frac{C \\cdot (a \\cdot C + b)}{C \\cdot (c \\cdot C + d) + e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>上式是 ACES 近似的一种形式。早期游戏多用简单的 Reinhard（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C/(1+C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）或 Uncharted2 曲线；2020 年后 ACES 成为电影级标准，而近年 Blender 引入的 AgX 因更好地处理高饱和高光而流行起来。色调映射处理的颜色源自 PBR 着色的 HDR 输出，见 <a href=\"../shading-techniques/pbr-materials\">PBR 材质</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"屏幕空间技术与-g-buffer\">屏幕空间技术与 G-Buffer</h2><p>很多高级后处理依赖延迟渲染留下的 G-Buffer——几张存着每像素法线、深度、材质参数的纹理。有了它们，后处理就能在屏幕空间「重建」场景信息做近似计算。SSAO（屏幕空间环境光遮蔽）就是典型：它在每个像素周围的半球内采样深度，统计有多少采样点被遮挡，以此近似环境光被几何遮蔽的程度，给墙角、缝隙加上自然的暗部。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"// 全屏 pass 顶点着色器：用顶点 ID 生成覆盖屏幕的大三角形&#10;VSOut FullscreenVS(uint id : SV_VertexID) {&#10;    VSOut o;&#10;    o.uv  = float2((id &lt;&lt; 1) &amp; 2, id &amp; 2);          // (0,0)(2,0)(0,2)&#10;    o.pos = float4(o.uv * 2.0 - 1.0, 0.0, 1.0);&#10;    o.uv.y = 1.0 - o.uv.y;                           // 翻转 V（D3D 约定）&#10;    return o;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 全屏 pass 顶点着色器：用顶点 ID 生成覆盖屏幕的大三角形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>VSOut FullscreenVS(uint id : SV_VertexID) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    VSOut o;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    o.uv  = float2((id &#x3C;&#x3C; 1) &#x26; 2, id &#x26; 2);          // (0,0)(2,0)(0,2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    o.pos = float4(o.uv * 2.0 - 1.0, 0.0, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    o.uv.y = 1.0 - o.uv.y;                           // 翻转 V（D3D 约定）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return o;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>屏幕空间技术的通病是「屏幕外信息缺失」——屏幕边缘或被遮挡处的几何无法参与计算，会产生瑕疵。这也是 SSAO、SSR（屏幕空间反射）逐渐被光线追踪与 Lumen 等方案补充的原因。屏幕空间 pass 大量读取全屏纹理，是带宽敏感型负载，见 <a href=\"../shading-techniques/texturing-sampling\">纹理与采样</a> 与 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/shader-optimization\">着色器性能优化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抗锯齿-从-msaa-到-taa-与上采样\">抗锯齿：从 MSAA 到 TAA 与上采样</h2><p>锯齿是离散采样的固有产物。MSAA 在几何边缘多重采样，质量高但对延迟渲染不友好且开销大。后处理式抗锯齿因此兴起：FXAA 纯靠分析屏幕图像找边缘并模糊，便宜但糊；TAA（时间抗锯齿）则跨多帧抖动采样、用运动向量重投影历史帧累积，是当前主流，但需小心鬼影。2026 年的前沿是机器学习驱动的时间上采样——以 DLSS、FSR、Unreal 的 TSR 为代表，它们在低分辨率渲染后用历史信息重建出高分辨率画面，本质是把抗锯齿与超分辨率合二为一，已成为大型游戏达成 4K/高帧率的标配。这些技术大量使用计算着色器，见 <a href=\"compute-shaders\">计算着色器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>后处理把渲染结果当输入纹理，用全屏 pass 逐像素再加工，多 pass 串成有严格顺序的处理链。</li>\n<li>HDR 效果（泛光）须在色调映射前；高斯模糊用可分离卷积把开销从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>色调映射把无界 HDR 压到可显示范围，ACES/AgX 是当前电影级标准。</li>\n<li>屏幕空间技术（SSAO/SSR）靠 G-Buffer 重建信息，但受「屏幕外缺失」限制。</li>\n<li>抗锯齿从 MSAA 走向 TAA，2026 年以 DLSS/FSR/TSR 为代表的 ML 时间上采样成为主流，大量依赖 <a href=\"compute-shaders\">计算着色器</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后处理效果","id":"后处理效果"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：全屏 Pass 与 Pipeline","id":"核心概念-全屏-pass-与-pipeline"},{"level":2,"text":"经典后处理效果剖析","id":"经典后处理效果剖析"},{"level":2,"text":"色调映射与 HDR","id":"色调映射与-hdr"},{"level":2,"text":"屏幕空间技术与 G-Buffer","id":"屏幕空间技术与-g-buffer"},{"level":2,"text":"抗锯齿：从 MSAA 到 TAA 与上采样","id":"抗锯齿-从-msaa-到-taa-与上采样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PBR 材质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/pbr-materials"},"next":{"title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/advanced-effects/compute-shaders"}}